1
00:00:00,087 --> 00:00:01,200
When a Transformer reads

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,325
the word sat, how does it decide

3
00:00:03,325 --> 00:00:04,638
which other words matter?

4
00:00:05,233 --> 00:00:06,833
This is the core idea of the

5
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:10,283
2017 paper Attention Is All You Need,

6
00:00:10,283 --> 00:00:11,771
by Ashish Vaswani

7
00:00:11,771 --> 00:00:13,046
and seven colleagues.

8
00:00:13,654 --> 00:00:14,992
Sat sends out a query,

9
00:00:14,992 --> 00:00:16,717
the vector one, two.

10
00:00:16,717 --> 00:00:18,842
Every word, sat included,

11
00:00:18,842 --> 00:00:19,829
holds up a key.

12
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,300
Multiply query and key

13
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,875
entry by entry, and add.

14
00:00:24,875 --> 00:00:27,238
That dot product scores each word:

15
00:00:27,238 --> 00:00:29,100
one, three, and two.

16
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,350
Then divide every score by

17
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,138
the square root of two,

18
00:00:33,138 --> 00:00:34,350
the key length,

19
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:35,575
so the numbers stay tame.

20
00:00:36,167 --> 00:00:37,654
A softmax turns the scores

21
00:00:37,654 --> 00:00:39,342
into weights that are positive

22
00:00:39,342 --> 00:00:42,067
and add up to one: point one four,

23
00:00:42,067 --> 00:00:43,179
point five eight,

24
00:00:43,179 --> 00:00:44,279
and point two eight.

25
00:00:44,867 --> 00:00:46,829
Each word also carries a value.

26
00:00:46,829 --> 00:00:49,729
Here, three points: four, zero.

27
00:00:50,079 --> 00:00:51,179
Four, four.

28
00:00:51,179 --> 00:00:52,405
And zero, four.

29
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,400
The output is the weighted

30
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:56,012
average of the values:

31
00:00:56,012 --> 00:00:57,962
a little of the, mostly cat,

32
00:00:57,962 --> 00:00:59,125
some sat.

33
00:00:59,125 --> 00:01:01,100
It lands near two point nine,

34
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:02,388
three point four.

35
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,237
That is attention:

36
00:01:04,237 --> 00:01:06,200
compare the query with every key,

37
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:08,000
scale, softmax,

38
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,450
and average the values.
